# ID_SENTENCE | IS_DISTINCT | MAX_NUM_COL | ID_SENT_TYPE | ID_GROUP_OBJECTS | OWNER_FLAG | OWNERSHIP | USABILITY | FILTER | FILTER_GROUP | APISQL
SAR_INCAPACIDAD_FAM | 0 | 0 | 1 |  | 80 |  |  | #I <= ? And ( #I >= ? Or #I IS NULL ) |  | SELECT @SCO_ID_HR = A.SCO_ID_HR, @SCO_ID_DISABILITY = A.SCO_ID_DISABILITY, @SCO_DT_START = A.SCO_DT_START, @SCO_DT_END = A.SCO_DT_END FROM &SCO_HR_DISABILITY A WHERE (A.SCO_DT_START <= @SAR_DT_ALLOC_END And ( A.SCO_DT_END >= @SAR_DT_ALLOC_START Or A.SCO_DT_END IS NULL ))
